{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nTherefore, $B={{u}_{1},{u}_{2}}={\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\end{bmatrix}}$ is an orthonormal basis of $V.$\n\nFinally, $a=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3},$ $b=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3},$ $c=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$ and  \n\n$$\n|a|+|b|+|c|=|\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\,|+|\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}|+|\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}|=\\sqrt{3}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366527 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366528 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366529 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366530 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366531 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186366531 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366526 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "48dad23b-c580-5561-a75c-a5c73aafe50d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366527 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{5}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366527 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366527 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6f024086-bc4f-50c7-879f-d67d9826ebee" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366528 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{5}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366528 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366528 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d74a082c-4c0c-540e-87e1-35c8ac407170" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366529 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{5}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366529 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #e